# Merged breed panel: 115MB of derived data, rebuilt by
# analysis/breed_accuracy/make_merged_plink.py + harmonize.py
breed_panel/

# Reference panels are build artifacts: regenerated from the 96-dog cohort by
# analysis/coverage_panel/build_panels.py whenever the builder changes. Tracking
# them meant every rebuild on Hoffman collided with the committed copy - it
# blocked three git pulls - and the CNV panel is 29MB, which would land in
# history again on every rebuild. Hoffman is the source of truth; sync by scp.
# Which panel produced a given report is recorded in that report's _meta
# (panel_n and panel_sha), not in git.
reference_panel/coverage_1mb_panel.json
reference_panel/coverage_cnv_panel.json

# Same lifecycle as the coverage panels: built on Hoffman from the cohort,
# synced by scp. See the note above.
reference_panel/microbiome_panel.json
relatives_ref/
